+# Project Specification: Pulseboard
+
+**Project ID**: 001-pulseboard  
+**Created**: 2026-08-10  
+**Status**: Planning  
+**Scale**: Level 2 — focused pilot product  
+**Recipe**: None — the brief does not constrain a technical stack
+
+---
+
+## 📊 Information Sources
+
+**Traceability**: This specification was created solely from `brief.md`. It is greenfield work; no recipe was selected because generic web-stack matches would prematurely decide the implementation. Brief omissions are recorded as explicit deferred decisions for the clarification phase.
+
+**Information Flow**: `brief.md` → `project.md` → `/project-clarify` → product and evidence contracts → context → plan.
+
